    "sensors": {
      "kind": "page",
      "description": "SENSORS as a dial cluster (ui_sensors.c + ui_dial.c + ui_sensor_model.c): ACCEL |a| on a 0-2 g dial with a 1 g rest tick (sensor is +-2 g per axis, so |a| can reach ~3.46 g: past 2 g the dial pins amber, the number stays exact), TEMP on the firmware's 60-90 F band, HUMIDITY 0-100 %. Trend line under each dial on the dial's scale (100 pts = 10 s accel, 60 pts = 60 s env; synthesized in fixtures). State words from the DIAGNOSTICS freshness rules: accel stale after 300 ms, temp+humidity (one AHT30 read) after 3 s. Values in fixtures are illustrative.",
      "sources": [
        "main/ui_kit.c",
